* Has the following targeting functionalities:
** {{Symbol|Target|Unit}}
*** When unit-targeted, applies {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|tinker_laser_blind}} on the unit-targeted enemy.
** {{Symbol|bonus t4r}} {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} {{to}} [[File:Dota2 Cast Range to AoE Visualization icon-9-1.png|84px]][[File:Dota2 Cast Range to AoE Visualization icon-9-2.png|84px]]
*** {{cf|talnotes}} The {{M|talent|t=t4r}} upgrade changes the ability targeting functionality from unit-targeted to {{ValueColor||unit and area-targeted|25tal}}.
**** Causes Laser to apply all ability effects to enemy units within radius [[File:Dota2 Letter-p.png|P|21px]] centered around the primary {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} unit-targeted enemy.
***** The radius damage does not affect the following units:
****** {{M|Fogged units}}.
****** {{M|Invisible}} units.

* {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|tinker_laser_blind}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
** Considers {{M|clones}} and {{M|illusions}} as heroes, {{M|creep-heroes}} as creeps.
** Reapplying the debuff refreshes its duration.
** Applies the following ability effects on the debuff-affected enemy units:
*** {{Symbol|Blind}}
**** [[Evasion#Stacking|Stacks]] additively with other [[blind]] sources and multiplicatively with {{M|evasion}} sources.
**** The debuff-affected attacking unit's has an ensured miss chance.
*** {{cf|aghnotes}}
**** {{Symbol|a|Down}} {{Symbol|Health}}
***** Applies both the max and current [[health]] reduction at the same time.
***** The debuff-affected enemy units do not regain the current health loss value upon debuff expiration.
**** {{Symbol|a|Down}} {{Symbol|Model Size}}
***** Applies a {{ValueColor||{{#var:Laser value4 agh}}|agh}} [[model size]] reduction.
***** Neither affects the unit's {{M|bound radius}} nor its {{M|collision size}}.

* {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
** The ability may apply its effects in different orders within the damage radius.
** {{Symbol|Target|Unit}}
*** The ability effects are applied as follows for the unit-targeted enemy:
***# {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|tinker_laser_blind}}
***# The {{M|pure}} {{M|spell damage}}.

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Laser icon0}}
| desc = Fires an intense energy beam, damaging and blinding the target. Blinded targets miss all physical attacks.
}}

