fields.value:
{{Rootnotes
| name = Keen Conveyance
| desc = [[Root]] sources nullifies both the ability cast, and cancels the {{M|teleport}} component if already {{M|channeling}}.
}}

 {{Teleportcard}}

* Has the following targeting functionalities:
** All targeting functionalities consider {{M|invulnerable}} units valid, but not {{M|hidden}} units.
** {{Symbol|Target|Unit}}
*** {{to}} {{Symbol|Affect|Ally}}
**** When unit-targeted on a valid allied unit or {{M|building}}, the ability {{M|teleports}} Tinker to the allied unit or building.
**** Considers {{M|clones}}, {{M|illusions}}, and the {{H|Spirit Bear}} as heroes, other {{M|creep-heroes}} as creeps.
*** {{to}} {{Symbol|Fountain}}
**** When {{Code|≥ {{#var:Keen Conveyance value2}}-distance}} from the {{M|faction}}'s [[fountain]], {{M|Doubletap}} casts the ability on the fountain.
** {{Symbol|Target|Point}} or {{Symbol|Target|Ground}}
*** {{M|Globally}} search for an allied unit or building to the point-targeted location, and teleport to the closest allied unit or building.

* The ability has two main components:
** [[File:Dota2 Condition-1.png|1|21px]] {{Symbol|bonus cd}}
*** The ability starts the game with a {{#var:Keen Conveyance value3}}-second [[cooldown]].
** [[File:Dota2 Condition-2.png|2|21px]] {{Symbol|Teleport}}
*** {{M|Disjoints}} incoming {{M|projectiles}} upon teleport.
*** {{Symbol|Channeling}}
**** Lowers the affected allied unit's incoming auto-attack priority while the teleport is [[channeling]].
**** {{Symbol|fx|v}} 
***** While channeling, the ability indicates the teleport destination visible for everyone, including teleporting to {{M|invisible}} units.
***** The teleport destination is also marked on the [[minimap]] visible ally-only.
**** {{Symbol|fx|s}}
***** While channeling, the teleport sound effects are audible for everyone.
*** [[File:Dota2 Tinker Keen Conveyance Teleport Visualization.png|84px]]
**** {{Symbol|Target|Point}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Buildings}}
***** The teleport to [[buildings]] cannot be interrupted once the channeling completes.
***** Has the following teleport distances for buildings:
****** [[File:Dota2 Letter-o.png|O|21px]] [[File:Dota2 Letter-b.png|B|21px]] is the min {{#var:Keen Conveyance type1 value1}}-teleport distance for all buildings.
****** [[File:Dota2 Letter-o.png|O|21px]] [[File:Dota2 Letter-r.png|R|21px]] is the max {{#var:Keen Conveyance type2 value5}}-teleport distance for {{M|Outposts}}.
******* Only successful teleports to Outposts increase the channeling time.
****** [[File:Dota2 Letter-o.png|O|21px]] [[File:Dota2 Letter-f.png|F|21px]] is the max {{#var:Keen Conveyance type1 value2}}-teleport distance for most buildings.
*** {{Symbol|Channeling|t}}
**** {{Symbol|Vision|Flying}}
***** Grants a {{#var:Keen Conveyance value1}} ({{ValueColor||{{#var:Keen Conveyance value1 tal}}|20tal}})-second {{Symbol|bonus aoe}} 200-radius [[flying vision]] at the teleport destination.
*** {{Symbol|Channeling|f}}
**** Does nothing, consumes {{M|mana}}, and goes into {{M|cooldown}}.
**** {{Symbol|Vision|Flying}}
***** Grants a 1-second {{Symbol|bonus aoe}} 200-radius flying vision at the teleport destination.

 * {{Symbol|Teleport}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Summons}}
** The [[teleport]] is interrupted on allied [[summon]] units in the following conditions:
